{"synopsis":"Yuma mendedikasikan hidupnya demi kekaisaran sebagai seorang kasim tapi dia difitnah dan dieksekusi\nAndaikan aku mendapat kesempatan sekali lagi\nKetika dia berpikir akan menemui ajalnya dia kembali ke masa lalu ketika dia berumur 16 tahun\nApa itu sekadar mimpi Tidak dia benarbenar kembali ke masa lalu dan dia tahu yang harus dilakukan\nAku tidak akan menjadi seorang kasim lagi\nDi kehidupan pertama dia memang menjalani kehidupan seorang kasim yang menyedihkan tapi tidak untuk kehidupan kali ini\nYuma menjadi kasim karena permainan takdir tapi dia kembali ke masa lalu juga termasuk takdir Dia akan mengubah semua kesalahan yang dilakukannya di kehidupan pertama ini adalah perjalanan Yuma mengubah takdir dunia","alternative_title":"Return to Sword Master","author":"Emperor Penguin","artist":"Kongdal","chapters":[{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"401029af-48c9-4e1e-972d-b87378885bc0","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"555cb7e9-7b53-4dcd-9b51-79db78139b53","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"4a35d597-b98a-4fce-a609-fcf1a135978e","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"9bdda49d-a4c7-46ba-980f-03c852939f12","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"abcb29b4-9ab6-48ee-b3e8-17148a282486","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"7b716371-4a82-4916-997b-09339e9c60fe","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"1d48860c-7ad1-439b-9f35-4582a20ec154","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"7ef46523-12db-4954-9934-2b5803297539","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"d7dead64-c791-49c3-9adb-049ab34f73d2","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"ab06ea4c-d680-403f-a393-1e94a6fb4c9e","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"2d7241db-2200-4c90-908f-8a08a8b36b7